{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 51, :comments ["<b>And it was on the very day.</b> It is joined to the verse after it: 'And it was on the very day' that <b>HaShem brought the children of Israel out of the land of Egypt, and HaShem spoke to Moses</b> — at midnight, at the time of the plague of the firstborn — to sanctify the firstborn of Israel and the firstborn of their livestock. And a proof for this: 'for every firstborn is mine, on the day I struck' etc." "<b>On their hosts.</b> Meaning: in their hosts."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:57:32.316861454Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}